{"sha": "994ab53dc9d6d0c9eb7710b242043dd22e059f35e2805020adbb9f75c486ad2a", "body": ["\\section*{Chapter \\ref{ch:g9:fractions} --- Fractions and Powers}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:fractions:1}", "$\\dfrac13 + \\dfrac15 = \\dfrac{5}{15} + \\dfrac{3}{15} = \\dfrac{8}{15}$.", "", "$\\dfrac72 - \\dfrac53 = \\dfrac{21}{6} - \\dfrac{10}{6} = \\dfrac{11}{6}$.", "", "$\\dfrac{5}{12} + \\dfrac38 = \\dfrac{10}{24} + \\dfrac{9}{24} =", "\\dfrac{19}{24}$.", "", "$3 - \\dfrac45 = \\dfrac{15}{5} - \\dfrac45 = \\dfrac{11}{5}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:fractions:2}", "$\\dfrac59 \\times \\dfrac{27}{35} = \\dfrac{5 \\times 27}{9 \\times 35}", "= \\dfrac{27}{9} \\times \\dfrac{5}{35} = 3 \\times \\dfrac17 = \\dfrac37$", "（分别约去 $9$ 与 $5$）。", "", "$\\dfrac{8}{15} \\div \\dfrac45 = \\dfrac{8}{15} \\times \\dfrac54", "= \\dfrac{8 \\times 5}{15 \\times 4} = \\dfrac{40}{60} = \\dfrac23$.", "", "$\\dfrac23 \\times \\dfrac34 \\times \\dfrac45 = \\dfrac{2 \\times 3 \\times 4}", "{3 \\times 4 \\times 5} = \\dfrac25$（约去 $3$ 与 $4$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:fractions:3}", "$2^5 = 32$; \\quad $(-2)^4 = 16$; \\quad $-2^4 = -16$; \\quad", "$4^{-2} = \\frac{1}{16}$; \\quad", "$\\left(\\frac23\\right)^3 = \\frac{8}{27}$; \\quad $7^0 = 1$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:fractions:4}", "$5^3 \\times 5^6 = 5^9$; \\quad $\\dfrac{7^9}{7^5} = 7^4$; \\quad", "$\\left(2^3\\right)^4 = 2^{12}$; \\quad", "$\\dfrac{3^2 \\times 3^7}{3^5} = 3^{9-5} = 3^4$; \\quad", "$2^5 \\times 4 = 2^5 \\times 2^2 = 2^7$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:fractions:5}", "$45\\,000 = 4.5 \\times 10^4$; \\quad", "$0.0072 = 7.2 \\times 10^{-3}$; \\quad", "$302.5 = 3.025 \\times 10^2$; \\quad", "$0.000\\,000\\,9 = 9 \\times 10^{-7}$; \\quad", "一千二百万 $= 1.2 \\times 10^7$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:fractions:6}", "$(2 \\times 10^7) \\times (4.5 \\times 10^{-3}) = 9 \\times 10^{4}$.", "", "$\\dfrac{9 \\times 10^5}{3 \\times 10^{-2}} = 3 \\times 10^{5 - (-2)}", "= 3 \\times 10^7$.", "", "$(5 \\times 10^3)^2 = 25 \\times 10^6 = 2.5 \\times 10^7$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:fractions:7}", "加入的水占水箱的", "$\\dfrac34 - \\dfrac35 = \\dfrac{15}{20} - \\dfrac{12}{20} = \\dfrac{3}{20}$", "容积。因此 $\\frac{3}{20}$ 的容积为 $30$ 升：", "$\\frac{1}{20}$ 对应 $10$ 升，容积为 $200$ 升。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:fractions:8}", "爱丽丝吃后，剩下蛋糕的 $1 - \\frac14 = \\frac34$。本", "吃掉 $\\frac13 \\times \\frac34 = \\frac14$，剩下", "$\\frac34 - \\frac14 = \\frac12$。卡拉吃掉其中的一半，即 $\\frac14$，", "剩下蛋糕的 $\\frac14$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:fractions:9}", "时间 $= \\dfrac{\\text{距离}}{\\text{速度}} =", "\\dfrac{1.5 \\times 10^{11}}{3 \\times 10^8} = 0.5 \\times 10^3 = 500$", "秒，即 $8$ 分钟 $20$ 秒。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:fractions:10}", "将两数都写成指数为 $10$ 的幂：", "\\[", "2^{30} = \\left(2^3\\right)^{10} = 8^{10},", "\\qquad", "3^{20} = \\left(3^2\\right)^{10} = 9^{10}.", "\\]", "由于 $8 < 9$，取十次幂得 $8^{10} < 9^{10}$，因此", "$2^{30} < 3^{20}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g9:fractions:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\frac14 = 0.25$（有限停止）；$\\frac13 = 0.333\\ldots$", "（循环节为 $3$）；$\\frac56 = 0.8333\\ldots$（循环节为 $3$，在", "$8$ 之后）；$\\frac{3}{11} = 0.272727\\ldots$（循环节为 $27$）。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 在以 $b$ 为除数的每一步中，余数", "是 $b$ 个可能值 $0, 1, \\dots, b - 1$ 中的一个", "（见\\cref{thm:g6:wholes:division}）。若余数 $0$ 出现，则", "除法停止。否则，至多经过 $b$ 步，", "必有某个余数第二次出现 --- 步数多于可能的余数个数 ---", "从那时起，除法", "恰好重复它在某余数首次出现之后所产生的数字序列，", "即小数的书写无限循环下去。要么停止，", "要么循环：不存在第三种情形。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $\\frac17 = 0.142857\\,142857\\ldots$：循环节", "$142857$ 的长度为 $6$。第 2 题保证在至多", "$7$ 步之内出现重复 --- 此处的余数", "$1, 3, 2, 6, 4, 5$ 都在 $1$ 再次出现之前出现，", "这是除以 $7$ 时可能的最长周期。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $\\frac ab$ 停止，当且仅当某个", "$\\frac{a \\times k}{b \\times k}$ 的分母为 $10$、$100$、", "$1000, \\dots$ --- 即分母能乘成", "十的幂，如 $4 \\times 25 = 100$ 或", "$8 \\times 125 = 1\\,000$。对 $3$ 与 $6$ 而言这是行不通的：一个", "十的幂的数字和为 $1$，而 $3$ 的每个倍数的数字和", "都是 $3$ 的倍数 --- 因此 $3$ 的倍数", "（从而 $6$ 的倍数也同样）绝不可能是 $10$、$100$、$1\\,000, \\dots$。对于", "$11$：$10$、$100$、$1\\,000$、$10\\,000$ 除以 $11$ 时总是", "留下余数（依次为 $10$、$1$、$10$、$1, \\dots$），从不为 $0$。", "分母能乘成十的幂的分数便会停止；其余的都会循环。", ""]}